    {
      "id": "mathematics-07-006",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "A rectangular tank 2m x 3m x 4m is full of water. If it is emptied into a cylindrical tank of radius 2m, find the height of the water level.",
      "options": {
        "A": "6/pi",
        "B": "12/pi",
        "C": "3/pi",
        "D": "24/pi"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Volume of rectangle = 24. Volume of cylinder = pi * 2^2 * h = 4pi*h. 4pi*h = 24 => h = 6/pi.",
      "hash": "a41836c48d26bfcf",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "2मी x 3मी x 4मी का एक आयताकार टैंक पानी से भरा है। यदि इसे 2मी त्रिज्या वाले बेलनाकार टैंक में खाली किया जाता है, तो पानी के स्तर की ऊँचाई ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "6/pi",
            "B": "12/pi",
            "C": "3/pi",
            "D": "24/pi"
          },
          "explanation": "आयताकार आयतन = 24। बेलनाकार आयतन = 4pi*h। 4pi*h = 24 => h = 6/pi."
        }
      }
    },
    {
